e="추론 요청" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;labelBackgroundColor=white;fontColor=#263445;fontSize=18;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1352" y="1380" width="91.16" height="30.3" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e81" value="결과" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;labelBackgroundColor=white;fontColor=#263445;fontSize=18;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1562" y="1460" width="44.0" height="30.3" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e83" value="색:  검정 = 공통     파랑 = T 전용     초록 = A/B 전용" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontColor=#263445;fontSize=19;fontStyle=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="64" y="1712" width="584.84" height="31.650000000000002" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e84" value="실선 → 요청/전달     점선 → 결과/복원" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontColor=#5B697B;fontSize=18;fontStyle=0;align=right;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="2126.92" y="1712" width="369.08" height="30.3" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e85" value="모양:  제목 칸이 있는 박스 = Component   |   내부 둥근 박스 = Module   |   원통 = 저장소   |   접힌 종이 = 자료   |   육각형 = 연동 대상/모델" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontColor=#5B697B;fontSize=17;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="64" y="1750" width="1347.26" height="28.950000000000003" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e86" value="검정 = 공통, 파랑/초록 = 바뀌는 처리. 단계가 많다는 사실은 정확도 우위의 증거가 아니다." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontColor=#5B697B;fontSize=17;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="64" y="1790" width="786.26" height="28.950000000000003" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e87" value="탐색안 / 미채택 / 미측정" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontColor=#5B697B;fontSize=17;fontStyle=0;align=right;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="2271.76" y="1790" width="224.24" height="28.950000000000003" /></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>
